# =====================================================================
# Release V022 -- Audit.usp_Run_Downstream utility
# =====================================================================
# DEV convenience: after changing one job, rebuild it + everything downstream (transitive)
# in dependency order. Sibling of usp_Rerun_Failed_Jobs but seeded from @Process_Code instead
# of the failure log. Per-tenant Bronze jobs run for every active tenant; Silver/Gold run once.
# @Preview=1 returns the ordered plan without executing.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V022__util_run_downstream.manifest
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Audit.usp_Run_Downstream.StoredProcedure.sql
